{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:Observations.NVTowerDepthNinety","@type":"LeanModule","name":"Observations.NVTowerDepthNinety","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.tower_depth_m_e_to_v_is_ninety","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.tower_depth_m_e_to_v_is_ninety","kind":"theorem","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/n-v-tower-depth-ninety.lean#L30-L38","doc":"**CONJECTURE.** The Coxeter-length tower depth between the m_e level and the\nv level equals 90 Hecke generations. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:n-v-tower-depth-ninety","label":"conj:n-v-tower-depth-ninety","md":"quantum-observable-universe/observations/n-v-tower-depth-ninety.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.TowerDepthNinetyConjecture.is_ninety","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.TowerDepthNinetyConjecture.is_ninety","kind":"theorem","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/n-v-tower-depth-ninety.lean#L28-L28","doc":"The depth is 90. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.TowerDepthNinetyConjecture.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.TowerDepthNinetyConjecture.mk","kind":"ctor","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/n-v-tower-depth-ninety.lean#L26-L26","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.TowerDepthNinetyConjecture","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.TowerDepthNinetyConjecture","kind":"class","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/n-v-tower-depth-ninety.lean#L24-L28","doc":"**CONJECTURE.** The Coxeter-length tower depth between the m_e level and the\nv level equals 90 Hecke generations. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.tower_depth","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.tower_depth","kind":"def","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/n-v-tower-depth-ninety.lean#L19-L22","doc":"Tower depth between two levels — the `depth` carried by the `BraneTower` structure.\nA genuine projection (no `sorry`); the conjectural content is the *value* `= 90` below. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.BraneTower.depth","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.BraneTower.depth","kind":"def","line":17,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/n-v-tower-depth-ninety.lean#L17-L17","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.BraneTower.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.BraneTower.mk","kind":"ctor","line":16,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/n-v-tower-depth-ninety.lean#L16-L16","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.BraneTower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.BraneTower","kind":"class","line":14,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/n-v-tower-depth-ninety.lean#L14-L17","doc":"A brane tower over `C` carries a Coxeter-length **depth** between any two levels\n(the number of Hecke generations separating them). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.GBCategory.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.GBCategory.mk","kind":"ctor","line":12,"sourceLink"